Strong CCD digicam aesthetic: direct flash, harsh shadow behind subject, bright facial highlights, visible grain, slight color inconsistency. Portra 400 skin rendering layered: warm balanced tones, creamy highlights, muted saturation. Shot on an {argument name="camera type" default="early-2000s CCD digital camera"}, direct on-camera flash, harsh flash falloff, bright hotspot on face and collarbone, slightly overexposed highlights, visible digital grain, imperfect snapshot framing. Color rendering inspired by Kodak Portra 400: warm creamy skin tones, pastel softness, muted saturation, gentle highlight roll-off layered over flash harshness. Neutral-to-warm white balance.

Makeup:
Rosy complexion, dewy skin with visible pores, brushed-up feathery brows, thin wing eyeliner, wispy eyelashes, grey contact lenses, pink lip gloss.

Hair:
Modern layered hairstyle with inward upward curled ends, messy windswept movement, face-framing strands crossing the eyes and cheeks, airy volume at the crown.

Negative prompt:
no plastic skin, no over-smoothing, no face change, no HDR, no teal-orange grading, no overly perfect studio lighting.', 'general', 'Chryz leen');
INSERT INTO prompts (title, content, category, author) VALUES ('Profile / Avatar - Autumn Park Relaxed Portrait', '32K ultra realistic DSLR 9:16 use uploaded face no change. Person sitting cross-legged on {argument name="setting" default="autumn leaves"}, calm direct look. Outfit: {argument name="outfit" default="sweatshirt + cargo pants + sneakers"} ” logo. Pose: one arm on knee, one hand on ground, relaxed. Background: {argument name="background" default="park with big tree"}, yellow-green leaves, soft bokeh. Natural sunlight, dappled shadows, cinematic, ultra detailed, HDR. PromptPixelRI signature. Negative: blur distortion face change.', 'general', 'ayzalnoor');
INSERT INTO prompts (title, content, category, author) VALUES ('Profile / Avatar - Moody Red Cinematic Portrait', 'Hyper-realistic dark Red portrait cinematic image actions. (uploaded photo 100% face match) of a very stunning {argument name="subject" default="19 years old age girl"} (followed by given picture face) Soft moody cinematic lighting highlights her facial features naturally. She leans casually pose, wearing {argument name="top" default="oversized red shirt"}, and she wear {argument name="bottom" default="wash lose jeans"} she wear white sleepers. hair simple hair cover her eyebrows, well-fitted complement the serene, The background backlight Keep my face air', 'general', 'ayzalnoor');
INSERT INTO prompts (title, content, category, author) VALUES ('Profile / Avatar - Artistic Royal Purple Portrait', 'Edit this photo without changing face, turning it an artistic portrait. The male boy should be elegantly seated on the floor, wearing a {argument name="top color" default="royal purple"} top, {argument name="pants style" default="soft loose white jeans"}, and {argument name="footwear" default="chunky gray and white sneakers"}. Her facial expression is cute smile while looking upwards. The background should be an artistic monochrome (black and white) composition featuring a soft close-up side profile of the same face. Keep Face and body 100% match with reference image uploaded it’s very important.Watermark: At the bottom, in a lower left corner, in small, bold, italicized brown text, write “Dpixel” and add a shooting star.watermark spelling correction is very important.', 'general', '𝐊𝐢𝐧𝐳𝐚| 𝗔𝗜');
INSERT INTO prompts (title, content, category, author) VALUES ('Profile / Avatar - Pop Art Silhouette Splatter', 'This image features a highly stylized silhouette profile of a young man with {argument name="hair style" default="tousled, dark hair"} and round glasses, set against a {argument name="background color" default="vibrant, saturated red"} background. The aesthetic leans heavily into a modern pop-art and street-art fusion, characterized by explosive, dynamic paint splatters in {argument name="splatter colors" default="electric purple and bright yellow"} that appear to trail off the subject’s head and shoulders, suggesting movement or a creative "burst" of thought.
​The lighting is dramatic and high-contrast, utilizing a chiaroscuro effect where the subject''s face is largely cast in deep shadow, while sharp red highlights define the bridge of his nose, lips, and neck. The overall composition is sleek and graphic, reminiscent of a contemporary digital illustration or a stylized comic book cover, evoking a sense of moody introspection combined with an energetic, artistic flair.', 'general', 'Minahil');
