INSERT INTO prompts (title, content, category, author) VALUES ('Profile / Avatar - 2000s Digicam Flash Portrait', 'A hyper-photorealistic shot of the same subject in the attached image, preserving exact facial identity, bone structure, proportions, and natural asymmetry with high fidelity.  Main subject / quality details: young {argument name="subject" default="East Asian male"}, toned arms visible, natural skin texture with visible pores, rosy complexion and dewy skin, soft highlight on collarbone and shoulders  Expression or mood: laid-back expression, slightly parted lips, eyes looking off-camera with relaxed confidence  Camera settings: shot on an {argument name="camera" default="old CCD digital camera"}, early-2000s digicam aesthetic, direct on-camera flash, harsh flash falloff, visible grain and digital noise, slightly overexposed highlights, flattened shadows, soft contrast, mildly washed colors, cool-to-neutral white balance, slight motion blur, low-light snapshot feel, candid and imperfect composition, crisp flash-lit subject, nostalgic compact-camera look, realistic unpolished image quality  Hair: {argument name="hair style" default="modern messy hairstyle with inward upward curl"}, slightly tousled from resting position  Outfit: white sleeveless tank top, relaxed-fit dark trousers, minimal jewelry  Background: soft fabric bedding with subtle wrinkles, neutral-toned indoor setting with natural window light  Composition: top-down diagonal angle, body stretched across frame, asymmetrical placement, leading lines from fabric folds  Negative prompt: cartoonish, AI-looking, plastic skin, distorted anatomy, over-smoothed face, blurry face, heavy bokeh, stiff pose, center-facing ID-photo style', 'general', 'Chryz leen');
INSERT INTO prompts (title, content, category, author) VALUES ('Social Media Post - Train-ad style book advertisement image', 'Please generate an advertisement image.

==== Ad specifications ===
- Aspect ratio: 16:9 (horizontal)
- Product to advertise: the book in the first attached image
- Main eye-catcher: place the book from the first attached image in a three-dimensional way
- Language: Japanese
- Taste: advertisement for a business book

# Text to include:
- Pre-head copy: 【New print run decided about one week after release】

Book “{argument name="book_title_en" default="Designing from Zero with AI"}” now on sale and doing well.

Amazon Best Seller Ranking
Ranked No.1 in commercial design sales (as of 10/15)
https://t.co/QxbYpfFVj6', 'general', 'KAWAI');
