INSERT INTO prompts (title, content, category, author) VALUES ('YouTube Thumbnail - Cinematic Night Taxi Portrait with Teal and Orange Grading', '"Image from subject, medium close-up, shot from outside through a reflective car window. The subject is ({argument name="subject position" default="seated in the rear right passenger seat"}), leaning back against the headrest, looking directly toward the camera through the glass. A hand is visible resting on the interior window frame. Wearing a light-colored crew-neck t-shirt and dark-tinted round sunglasses. The setting is a taxi interior at night. The background is a blurred urban landscape with bright bokeh from traffic and neon signs. Rain droplets and condensation are present on the glass surface. Cinematic teal-and-orange color palette. Vibrant red and green neon reflections are projected onto the subject and the window glass. High-contrast lighting with deep, crushed shadows and warm, hazy highlights. Dense 35mm film grain, heavy glass reflections, lens flares, and soft chromatic aberration at the edges. "', 'general', 'Arsistyle');
INSERT INTO prompts (title, content, category, author) VALUES ('YouTube Thumbnail - Drake with Orbiting Glass Music Interfaces', 'Numerous 3D Spotify and Apple Music interface cards orbiting Drake at varying depths.
Material: Translucent frosted glass (glassmorphism) with soft rounded edges and subtle glowing borders.
 Movement: Some cards are in the extreme foreground, partially obscuring Drake, while others drift into the distance behind him.
Visual Accents: Dynamic motion blur on the edges of the cards to suggest a swirling, orbiting movement.
LIGHTING & COMPOSITION
Lighting: Natural tones with enhanced professional photo quality. The soft glow from the interface cards subtly illuminates Drake’s face.
Focus: Strong depth of field. The background and extreme foreground cards are artistically blurred, keeping the focus sharp on Drake and the closest player interfaces.
Composition: A cinematic wide or medium shot that emphasizes the scale of the floating AR elements.
AESTHETIC
High-end editorial music photography, futuristic AR concept, clean and airy vibe. 8k resolution, sophisticated lighting, and realistic textures on the glass cards.', 'general', 'Kashberg');
INSERT INTO prompts (title, content, category, author) VALUES ('YouTube Thumbnail - Cinematic Food Short Video Prompt (Summary)', 'A cinematic food short video composed of 4 cuts, emphasizing warm lighting and ASMR sound. It smoothly transitions from rhythmic ingredient cuts captured with a macro lens to a slow-motion frying scene. Shallow depth of field is used to depict cute hand plating, concluding with the finished dish and the lingering feeling of the meal. Utilizing match cuts and motion blur to create an immersive experience where sight and sound seamlessly connect.', 'summarize', '空想写真家');
INSERT INTO prompts (title, content, category, author) VALUES ('YouTube Thumbnail - Image Transformation Prompt for Nano Banana Pro (Content Creator Studio)', 'Transform this image into a modern content creator studio. Place the subject sitting at a desk with a professional podcast setup, including a mounted microphone arm and studio microphone in front of them. Add acoustic foam panels on the walls for a soundproof studio look. Include colorful LED tube lights (blue and pink tones) in the background for a cinematic YouTube aesthetic. He''s wearing a nice jacket with nice apple airpods.Keep the subject’s face realistic and unchanged, with natural skin tones. Add soft, professional lighting on the face (key light + subtle rim light).
Style: high-quality YouTube creator setup, cinematic lighting, vibrant but clean colors, sharp focus, professional studio environment, modern and minimal.', 'creative', 'K');
INSERT INTO prompts (title, content, category, author) VALUES ('YouTube Thumbnail - Cinematic 3x3 Grid Camera Angle Prompt', 'A cinematic 3×3 grid presenting multiple camera angles of the same female subject outdoors at dusk. A young woman wearing a patterned black shirt stands beside a car on a rural road, surrounded by open fields and distant hills. Each frame shows a distinct shot: extreme close-up, medium shot, over-the-shoulder, wide shot, high-angle top-down, low-angle, profile, three-quarter rear view, and full back view. Natural blue-hour lighting, soft sky gradients, realistic colors, shallow depth of field, cinematic framing. Consistent subject appearance across all frames, film-still aesthetic, professional cinematography reference sheet style, ultra-realistic photography.', 'general', 'K');
INSERT INTO prompts (title, content, category, author) VALUES ('YouTube Thumbnail - Decorative Cinematic Title Font Generation', 'Based on the word “{argument name="word" default="[WORD]"},” design an original decorative cinematic title font that visually evokes the meaning of the word. Use your imagination to create a unique and original design without being limited by existing typefaces. Choose the background color according to the design.', 'general', 'underwood');
INSERT INTO prompts (title, content, category, author) VALUES ('Comic / Storyboard - Cinematic Reptilian Transformation Scene', 'A hyper-realistic cinematic transformation scene of a {argument name="subject" default="young person"} (use my uploaded face), standing in a {argument name="lighting" default="dark, moody environment with subtle green and amber lighting"}. The body is mid-transformation into a powerful {argument name="creature" default="humanoid reptile creature"}. The face still clearly resembles the original human, but with emerging reptilian features, glowing slit pupils, textured scales spreading across the skin, and sharp defined jawlines.

The transformation is dynamic, one side of the body still human wearing modern casual clothing (dark jacket, fitted tee), while the other side evolves into a muscular reptilian form with glossy, detailed scales, clawed fingers, and faint bioluminescent veins. Skin cracking effect with glowing energy beneath, as if evolution is happening in real-time.

Add cinematic smoke, floating dust particles, and subtle sparks in the air. Background should be minimal, dark studio or abandoned sci-fi lab, slightly blurred for depth. Lighting should highlight texture contrast between human skin and reptile scales.

Ultra-detailed, 8K, sharp focus on face, dramatic shadows, high contrast, volumetric lighting, photorealistic, Unreal Engine style render, cinematic composition, shallow depth of field.', 'general', 'Snow');
INSERT INTO prompts (title, content, category, author) VALUES ('Comic / Storyboard - Vibrant 3D Cartoon Characters Stack', 'A vibrant, 3D illustration features a stack of four cartoon characters against a {argument name="background" default="warm, gradient orange background"}. The characters are predominantly {argument name="colors" default="purple and blue"}, with large, expressive eyes and wide smiles. At the top is a large, purple creature with big, floppy ears and a white face, resembling a rabbit or a monkey. It has orange eyes and pink cheeks. Below it is a smaller, blue-faced creature with orange eyes and a wide, toothy grin, also with purple arms and body. It has a light blue heart shape on its chest. The third level features two characters side-by-side. On the left is a purple cat-like creature with blue eyes and a pink collar. On the right is a white, bald character with orange eyes and orange accents on its arms and body, adorned with small orange hearts. At the bottom, partially visible, is a purple dog-like creature with a playful expression. The entire composition is surrounded by {argument name="decoration" default="numerous small, colorful heart shapes in shades of purple, pink, orange, and blue"}, adding to the cheerful and whimsical atmosphere. The characters are perched on a textured, purple base that resembles a mound of soft clay or frosting.', 'general', 'Heather Green');
INSERT INTO prompts (title, content, category, author) VALUES ('Comic / Storyboard - Absurdist Office Workspace Fire', 'A wide side-angle shot captures a young woman seated in her office workspace. The camera sits at a slight diagonal, providing a three-quarter view of both her body and the contemporary desk setup, enhancing depth while introducing a slightly unpolished, candid feel typical of early digital photography.
Outfit: {argument name="clothing" default="white dress shirt with rolled sleeves, slightly loosened patterned tie, slim black trousers or pencil skirt, white socks, beige sneakers"} — all actively burning. Her long hair is slightly messy from the heat.
Scene: fire spreads across the floor, walls, and glass partitions. The desk, CRT monitor, keyboard, coffee mug, and mouse reflect the flames.
Lighting: {argument name="lighting style" default="harsh on-camera flash (Y2K digital look)"} creates sharp highlights and flattens parts of the scene. Fire is overexposed in places with clipped highlights. Conflicting color temperatures: cool flash vs warm firelight.
Digital look: visible noise in shadows, slight color banding, over-sharpened edges, compressed dynamics. High depth of field, everything in focus, flash-frozen moment.
Mood: absurd, darkly humorous realism. Calm young woman working while everything burns, making direct eye contact.
Color palette: dark gray, desaturated neutrals interrupted by aggressive oranges and yellows from fire.', 'general', 'Dr. Samia');
INSERT INTO prompts (title, content, category, author) VALUES ('Comic / Storyboard - Pen-and-Ink Cross-Hatching Illustration', 'Stylized digital illustration of a young woman with a warm, confident smile, executed in a pen-and-ink cross-hatching style. She has short, wavy {argument name="hair color" default="purple"} hair with prominent blonde face-framing streaks, parted down the middle. Her facial features are rendered with fine stippling and line work, highlighting her expressive eyes, light freckles, and a friendly grin. She wears a {argument name="shirt color" default="dark purple"} textured t-shirt, a delicate necklace, hoop earrings, and thin rings on her fingers, with one hand resting gently under her chin. The background is a solid, dense black cross-hatched texture that makes the subject pop, giving the piece a classic graphic novel or hand-drawn editorial aesthetic.', 'general', 'Minahil');
INSERT INTO prompts (title, content, category, author) VALUES ('Comic / Storyboard - Vector Animation Style Character Illustration', '{argument name="art style" default="clean vector animation style"} illustration of the {argument name="subject" default="person in the provided image"}, featuring simplified geometric shapes, smooth lines, and flat colors. Maintain accurate facial features, hairstyle, and expression while stylizing them in a modern 2D animated look. Use bold outlines, minimal shading, and a {argument name="palette" default="vibrant but balanced color palette"}. Ensure a polished, high-contrast, professional vector design with a subtle gradient or flat background', 'general', 'Shushant Lakhyani');
INSERT INTO prompts (title, content, category, author) VALUES ('Comic / Storyboard - Gritty Urban Superhero Portrait', 'cinematic portrait of the person in the provided image reimagined as a {argument name="character inspiration" default="Daredevil-inspired character"}, without a mask, holding a red vigilante mask in one hand. Preserve accurate facial features, hairstyle, and expression. Style the scene with a {argument name="atmosphere" default="dark, gritty urban atmosphere"}, {argument name="lighting" default="dramatic lighting, and subtle red highlights"}. Include a sleek, form-fitting suit inspired by Daredevil’s design (no logos), realistic textures, and high detail. Ensure a powerful, intense mood with sharp focus and a blurred city background', 'general', 'Shushant Lakhyani');
INSERT INTO prompts (title, content, category, author) VALUES ('Comic / Storyboard - Man with Zootopia Characters in Alpine Cable Car', 'A photorealistic, eye-level medium shot taken from inside a modern glass cable car. The {argument name="subject" default="man"} is sitting on a slatted wooden bench, wearing a black long-sleeve crewneck sweater and light beige trousers. He has his arms affectionately wrapped around two highly detailed 3D animated characters from Zootopia: {argument name="first character" default="Judy Hopps"}, wearing her blue police tactical uniform, is seated on his right, and {argument name="second character" default="Nick Wilde"}, wearing his green button-down shirt and striped tie, is seated on his left. Through the large panoramic windows behind them, there is a bright, majestic snow-covered alpine mountain landscape. In the mid-ground outside, a red and white passenger train is crossing an arched stone viaduct bridge. Bright natural daylight illuminates the interior, casting soft shadows and seamlessly blending the 3D cartoon characters into the photorealistic, live-action environment.
Ratio 4:5', 'general', 'Nexora');
INSERT INTO prompts (title, content, category, author) VALUES ('Comic / Storyboard - Heroic Fantasy Warrior Portrait', '{
    "subject": {
        "description": "{argument name="subject description" default="A powerful warrior woman"}",
        "features": {
            "hair": "long, dark, windswept",
            "expression": "intense, determined, serious",
            "pose": "standing, heroic stance, looking directly at camera",
            "armor": {
                "type": "fantasy-classical hybrid",
                "materials": ["highly polished gold filigree", "blackened metal"],
